WEBVTT

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:16.617
Abiru hodo dakiattari kuchizuke shitari

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:22.823
Abiru hodo kenka shitari aishiattari

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:29.029
Ari no mama omae no koto shiritai kuse ni

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:34.768
Ari no mama nante narenai ore no hou sa

00:00:34.902 --> 00:00:37.905
Wakaranai

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.641
Omae no kokoro ga

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.643
Nazedayo

00:00:42.643 --> 00:00:47.281
Honto wa majutsushi kai?

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.451
Dakishimetai

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:55.055
Hitori ja cry

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:59.726
Mou nido to hitori ja itakunai

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.064
Dakishimetai

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:07.367
Omae to fly

00:01:07.768 --> 00:01:15.142
Marude naiteru youna kanjiteru koe ni toketeiku

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:21.648
Serenade

00:01:38.432 --> 00:01:40.534
Damn...

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:45.839
Why do we have to do
blue-collar work like carrying herbs,

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:49.009
and tending to wounds?!

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:51.979
But I just couldn't leave it alone.

00:01:51.979 --> 00:01:54.414
Big Brother, it's not as if we're
complete strangers, right?

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:58.018
That's the truth.
| feel like we're blood related siblings.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:00.020
What does that mean?!

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:04.658
Saved...

00:02:04.992 --> 00:02:07.027
Big Brother, you're heavy.

00:02:09.196 --> 00:02:11.264
Conscious again!

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:12.699
I'm so glad!

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.868
I'm not glad!

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:16.536
That monster!

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:19.072
I'll peek him to death in an outdoor bath!

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:01.848
We're back, aren't we?

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:07.921
Yeah, all the mysteries are here
in these ruins, you know.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:16.363
But is there really a correct way
to use the Sword of Baltanders?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.366
There is. There has to be.

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:21.768
No matter how much Childman interferes,

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:25.906
| will return Azalie to her true self
with my own hands.

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.075
I'm here too, you know!

00:03:28.075 --> 00:03:30.343
Don't forget that, Master!

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:34.014
You two, it's fine for you to get all excited,

00:03:34.014 --> 00:03:38.752
but how are we going to find a clue
inside these huge ruins?

00:03:39.486 --> 00:03:42.556
Well, that's... I'll do something.

00:03:42.556 --> 00:03:45.459
But there are a lot of things
like those doors that don't open!

00:03:45.459 --> 00:03:46.893
Do you have an idea or something?

00:03:47.294 --> 00:03:49.062
Yes, we do have an idea.

00:03:49.496 --> 00:03:50.831
You are...

00:03:50.831 --> 00:03:52.065
Is this for real?

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.500
This is a lie, right?

00:03:58.438 --> 00:03:59.773
Stephanie!

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:02.642
It's been a while.

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:09.349
RAINBOW COLORED SECRET

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:23.764
We are most grateful that you
massacred Bloody August for us.

00:04:24.064 --> 00:04:28.068
With this, there are none to cause
the Tower of Fangs fear.

00:04:28.869 --> 00:04:30.871
It was admirable work.

00:04:30.871 --> 00:04:35.342
Please use that power to aid
the Tower of Fangs from now on.

00:04:36.176 --> 00:04:39.646
My body and soul have been given
long ago to the Tower of Fangs.

00:04:39.646 --> 00:04:42.015
All is as you have spoken.

00:04:42.616 --> 00:04:44.451
We expect much of you,

00:04:45.185 --> 00:04:46.419
Childman.

00:04:46.987 --> 00:04:51.057
I shall carve your words
into my heart, Shasutadeji.

00:05:12.846 --> 00:05:17.017
It was just as expected of Master
that he annihilated Bloody August.

00:05:17.017 --> 00:05:18.251
Right, Hartia?

00:05:21.221 --> 00:05:22.522
| understand how you feel,

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:24.925
but there was nothing else
we could do about Azalie.

00:05:25.959 --> 00:05:27.961
Is that true, Master?

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.765
No, it's nothing.

00:05:33.133 --> 00:05:34.334
Hartia...

00:05:39.239 --> 00:05:41.942
Now there is no one who knows my identity.

00:05:41.942 --> 00:05:45.245
With this, everything is mine,
including the Tower of Fangs.

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.081
And this power, all of it!

00:05:48.882 --> 00:05:51.685
Verdict of Nonexistence!

00:05:54.888 --> 00:05:56.223
But why?

00:05:56.656 --> 00:06:01.995
With this much power it would have been
such an easy thing to kill me.

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:05.465
| don't know what you were thinking,

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:08.368
but it's too late now, Childman.

00:06:09.236 --> 00:06:11.905
Rather, Bloody August.

00:06:22.749 --> 00:06:23.917
To the other side!

00:06:27.821 --> 00:06:29.823
What are you thinking?

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:32.058
Master, at this rate...

00:06:32.626 --> 00:06:36.630
Don't show up in front of me again, Hartia!

00:06:38.732 --> 00:06:41.534
You're just taunting Krylancelo.

00:06:51.945 --> 00:06:53.680
All right, I'm going to do it.

00:07:16.636 --> 00:07:17.804
How about that?

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:19.572
Just is as expected of my ex-partner, right?

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:22.042
What? What just happened?

00:07:22.042 --> 00:07:25.512
The sorcerous runes were the key to the door.

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:28.448
That's why they didn't open until now.

00:07:28.815 --> 00:07:33.586
| wonder what we'd be doing now
if it weren't for Stephanie, Majic?

00:07:33.987 --> 00:07:37.457
What? If I had those ancient documents,
| could open them too!

00:07:39.526 --> 00:07:42.329
What, Leki, you're saying that too?
How mean!

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:44.564
Don't be stupid! Let's go!

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:45.932
Okay!

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:50.203
Room of Knowledge?

00:07:50.203 --> 00:07:53.073
Yes. Since parting with you,

00:07:53.073 --> 00:07:56.076
I've been investigating the
Ruins of Alenhatan and discovered it.

00:07:56.276 --> 00:08:00.246
All the knowledge of the Heavenly Beings
is in the Room of Knowledge.

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:02.649
It's hidden in these ruins.

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:07.153
The secret of the Sword of Baltanders
should be there too.

00:08:07.387 --> 00:08:11.624
The way to return Azalie to herself
is in the Room of Knowledge.

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:14.294
So, in short...

00:08:14.294 --> 00:08:16.196
well... well...

00:08:16.563 --> 00:08:19.399
Well, something like the library
of the Heavenly Beings.

00:08:19.566 --> 00:08:23.570
In short, it means that we don't need anyone
who can't read sorcerous runes, right?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.051
A doll?!

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:40.987
It's dangerous! Get back!

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:43.890
Sword of Light, whom I do-

00:08:46.259 --> 00:08:48.762
Inspection of Morning Fog, that I sing!

00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:54.234
Master...

00:08:54.234 --> 00:08:55.435
Don't try so hard!

00:08:55.435 --> 00:08:58.038
Think of where you are when you choose magic!

00:08:58.038 --> 00:09:00.473
If there was an explosion
in this cramped place,

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:02.475
we wouldn't have come out unscathed.

00:09:05.845 --> 00:09:07.347
Don't worry about it!

00:09:07.347 --> 00:09:10.283
With your magic, we probably
would have been fine, Majic!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:13.253
Is that supposed to make me feel better?

00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:21.394
I'm really such a pathetic apprentice.

00:09:45.218 --> 00:09:46.719
Th-this is...

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.162
Wow, there's water in here.

00:10:00.467 --> 00:10:03.937
See how sparkly! It's so pretty, isn't it?

00:10:07.207 --> 00:10:09.209
This is the Room of Knowledge?

00:10:09.209 --> 00:10:10.877
But there's so many...

00:10:10.877 --> 00:10:15.782
Hey, Stephanie, is this really
the knowledge of the Heavenly Beings?

00:10:16.416 --> 00:10:18.918
Trust in your ex-partner!

00:10:19.185 --> 00:10:20.720
Okay, now watch.

00:10:27.127 --> 00:10:28.995
This is the Water of Knowledge.

00:10:28.995 --> 00:10:30.797
Water of Knowledge?

00:10:31.197 --> 00:10:35.768
The Heavenly Beings had the technology
to bind important knowledge into water,

00:10:35.768 --> 00:10:38.404
and this crystal is that Water of Knowledge.

00:10:38.872 --> 00:10:44.277
So that means, information on the
Sword of Baltanders is in these crystals.

00:10:44.577 --> 00:10:47.981
That means that we have to
find it among all these?

00:10:48.414 --> 00:10:49.382
Oh, no!

00:10:54.888 --> 00:10:56.556
This isn't it.

00:10:56.556 --> 00:10:58.491
Not this one either.

00:10:58.691 --> 00:11:00.894
Geez, there's no end to them!

00:11:02.395 --> 00:11:06.666
Congratulations, with this one,
it's ninety-nine misses in a row.

00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:09.035
This isn't it again.

00:11:09.602 --> 00:11:13.006
"Differentiated Intervals,

00:11:13.006 --> 00:11:18.344
a Swift Yet Pertinent Technique
to Communicate Intent?"

00:11:20.647 --> 00:11:25.718
"Regarding Psychological Suppression,
an Inquiry into the Efficiency of Magic?"

00:11:26.119 --> 00:11:30.723
| don't understand the way
Heavenly Beings think at all!

00:11:32.492 --> 00:11:34.661
You've studied a lot, haven't you?

00:11:35.728 --> 00:11:39.933
Didn't you study sorcerous runes
on your own? You're pretty good.

00:11:40.733 --> 00:11:44.337
But I can't compare at all to you, Stephanie!

00:11:44.337 --> 00:11:46.039
That's not true!

00:11:46.039 --> 00:11:48.875
You're a lot of help to Orphen!

00:11:49.108 --> 00:11:50.677
Is that true?

00:11:50.677 --> 00:11:54.247
Because I want to be of use to Master,
even if it's only a little.

00:11:54.247 --> 00:11:57.050
Even though I'm like this,
I am his apprentice.

00:11:57.684 --> 00:11:59.419
What a great apprentice you are!

00:11:59.419 --> 00:12:03.523
Though of course, the Master has
defects in his character, right?

00:12:03.523 --> 00:12:05.592
| said, don't bother me!

00:12:07.427 --> 00:12:10.630
What's wrong with letting me
know what it says?

00:12:18.271 --> 00:12:20.340
This one. What does it say?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.208
Hey, Orphen!

00:12:24.143 --> 00:12:25.912
Tell me! Tell me!

00:12:27.247 --> 00:12:28.348
What?

00:12:28.348 --> 00:12:30.516
Don't move. I'll read it for you right now.

00:12:30.516 --> 00:12:33.286
"Full Course Recipe for
Heavenly Being-ish Herbs

00:12:33.286 --> 00:12:35.188
that Anyone Can Make," is what it says.

00:12:35.188 --> 00:12:36.556
Really?!

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:41.327
No, you can't. Don't start thinking
you can take these home.

00:12:41.327 --> 00:12:46.132
Why not? Orphen, don't you want to eat
a full course Heavenly Being meal?

00:12:46.499 --> 00:12:47.767
| don't need it!

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:52.472
Cheapie! It's a Heavenly Being full course
meal that no one else has eaten!

00:12:52.839 --> 00:12:54.807
We don't have time for that right now.

00:12:54.807 --> 00:12:58.945
All I want is information on
the Sword of Baltanders!

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.714
Good girl.

00:13:03.549 --> 00:13:05.285
Such a single-minded person!

00:13:05.652 --> 00:13:07.453
It's just like Master.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:13.293
Baltanders...

00:13:13.593 --> 00:13:15.161
Majic, that's...

00:13:16.229 --> 00:13:17.563
Did it!

00:13:34.047 --> 00:13:36.149
| found it, Master!

00:13:36.149 --> 00:13:38.618
It's the crystal of Baltanders!

00:13:38.618 --> 00:13:40.586
Really?! I'm coming right now!

00:13:42.088 --> 00:13:43.389
Yay!

00:13:43.389 --> 00:13:46.592
Hey, Master, please look. This is it, right?

00:13:48.161 --> 00:13:49.796
Baltanders...

00:13:50.697 --> 00:13:52.265
With this, Azalie...

00:14:02.041 --> 00:14:03.609
It's all right now.

00:14:04.043 --> 00:14:06.212
Well, just now...

00:14:06.212 --> 00:14:09.849
Probably a Heavenly Being device
to protect the Water of Knowledge.

00:14:10.249 --> 00:14:12.985
It seems it's against the rules
to take things out of the library.

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:15.855
The Heavenly Beings are such
hard heads, aren't they?

00:14:19.225 --> 00:14:20.360
That idiot!

00:14:23.463 --> 00:14:28.301
What?! All I wanted to do
was make Orphen a delicious meal!

00:14:28.901 --> 00:14:32.338
Cleao, that's it! Put that crystal back!

00:14:32.338 --> 00:14:33.539
Which one?

00:14:34.741 --> 00:14:38.010
This one? That one? Which one is it?

00:14:40.146 --> 00:14:43.516
I'm sorry! It was just a sudden impulse!

00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:53.126
Run!

00:14:54.327 --> 00:14:56.596
Armour of Ice, that doth spin around me!

00:15:03.102 --> 00:15:07.039
Wasn't it you, Orphen, that said to think about
where you are when you use magic?!

00:15:07.039 --> 00:15:09.642
That was just to show an example of
what bad things can happen.

00:15:09.642 --> 00:15:10.810
Anyway, run!

00:15:18.117 --> 00:15:20.119
Majic, where are you going?

00:15:20.686 --> 00:15:22.188
Where're you going, Majic?!

00:15:22.188 --> 00:15:25.158
It can't be, that child...
the crystal of Baltanders!

00:15:25.158 --> 00:15:26.125
That...

00:15:29.228 --> 00:15:31.631
Sword of the Descending Demon,
that I doth carry!

00:15:34.367 --> 00:15:36.302
Come back, Majic!

00:15:36.536 --> 00:15:37.637
| don't want to!

00:15:37.637 --> 00:15:38.738
What did you say?!

00:15:38.738 --> 00:15:42.608
If we give up here, then what did we
come this far for, Master?

00:15:43.176 --> 00:15:44.310
But!

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:45.912
| can't give up!

00:15:46.379 --> 00:15:48.581
Stupid, don't try too hard!

00:15:48.781 --> 00:15:50.249
| will try too hard!

00:15:50.249 --> 00:15:52.518
Whose apprentice do you think I am?

00:15:52.919 --> 00:15:53.953
What?!

00:15:59.192 --> 00:16:01.227
With this, Master will...

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.334
Majic!

00:16:11.537 --> 00:16:13.339
That can't be...

00:16:14.474 --> 00:16:16.275
What's wrong, Majic?

00:16:17.009 --> 00:16:18.411
Are you all right?!

00:16:18.411 --> 00:16:23.416
I'm all right, but the water's spilling out!

00:16:23.616 --> 00:16:24.717
What?!

00:16:25.751 --> 00:16:27.119
Cleao?

00:16:27.119 --> 00:16:29.222
Get a hold of yourself, Orphen!

00:16:29.789 --> 00:16:30.790
Thank you.

00:16:40.766 --> 00:16:43.236
Inspection of Morning Fog, that I sing!

00:16:46.506 --> 00:16:49.041
Inspection of Morning Fog, that I sing!

00:16:49.041 --> 00:16:53.412
That's right, cryo-magic.
If you freeze the Water of Knowledge...

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.415
you can take it out that way!

00:16:56.415 --> 00:16:57.683
You...

00:16:58.751 --> 00:17:01.387
Inspection of Morning Fog, that I sing!

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:09.862
I'm no good after all am I?

00:17:10.229 --> 00:17:11.497
Don't give up!

00:17:13.065 --> 00:17:14.800
Don't I always tell you?!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.337
When you use magic, first unify your mind!

00:17:18.337 --> 00:17:19.772
Master!

00:17:20.706 --> 00:17:22.742
It's too hard. I can't possibly-

00:17:22.742 --> 00:17:23.743
Idiot!

00:17:24.544 --> 00:17:26.979
Whose apprentice do you think you are?

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:32.184
Master...

00:17:32.785 --> 00:17:33.886
Yes!

00:17:35.321 --> 00:17:36.756
Next, imagine.

00:17:36.756 --> 00:17:39.025
Imagine the completed magic.

00:17:39.025 --> 00:17:40.026
Yes!

00:17:40.593 --> 00:17:42.728
As realistically as you can.

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:44.196
Throw away your doubts!

00:17:44.564 --> 00:17:45.464
Yes!

00:17:51.771 --> 00:17:53.773
Is it going to be all right with Majic?

00:17:53.773 --> 00:17:56.175
Who do you think he is?

00:17:56.609 --> 00:17:58.110
He's my apprentice!

00:18:05.251 --> 00:18:08.454
Inspection of Morning Fog, that I sing!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.545
| did it!

00:18:32.979 --> 00:18:36.215
| did it, Master! Master!

00:18:36.782 --> 00:18:39.051
What a thoughtful apprentice.

00:18:39.051 --> 00:18:43.556
| bet his feelings for you
made his magic successful.

00:18:46.292 --> 00:18:48.961
Looks like he won't be able
to do this one again,

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:50.997
but he does have a lot of promise.

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:53.032
That...

00:18:58.871 --> 00:19:01.040
That's funny.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:05.811
Why? Why did the sorcerous runes
stop coming out all of a sudden?

00:19:06.312 --> 00:19:08.781
Maybe because it's turned from water to ice.

00:19:08.781 --> 00:19:11.917
It's hardened, and you can't get
the information from it anymore.

00:19:12.218 --> 00:19:13.719
But that's...

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:22.194
Majic...

00:19:23.262 --> 00:19:27.667
I'm sorry, Master, after we've come this far...

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:36.409
It's a bit early to give up!

00:19:38.778 --> 00:19:41.080
What do you plan to do, Orphen?

00:19:49.422 --> 00:19:51.991
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:19:55.094 --> 00:19:56.595
What did you do?!

00:19:56.595 --> 00:19:59.298
Majic risked his life to bring it!

00:19:59.298 --> 00:20:00.700
It's all right.

00:20:02.034 --> 00:20:03.102
Look!

00:20:04.303 --> 00:20:06.939
The sorcerous runes? Why?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.575
| see.

00:20:09.742 --> 00:20:12.211
The Water of Knowledge
spread out across the sky

00:20:12.211 --> 00:20:16.415
reflects the morning light
just like a rainbow of sorcerous runes.

00:20:17.249 --> 00:20:21.887
I'm jealous that you have a
good apprentice and a good partner.

00:20:23.456 --> 00:20:26.292
Thank you, Majic,
just as expected of my apprentice.

00:20:26.792 --> 00:20:27.693
Yes!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.875
To the dust from which you originated.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.428
Excuse me.

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.866
Master, I have something to tell you.

00:21:07.133 --> 00:21:08.334
To dust.

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:20.479
| do not need such things.

00:21:27.453 --> 00:21:28.954
It's become a horrible thing!

00:21:28.954 --> 00:21:32.358
Yeah, they say Bloody August is still alive!

00:21:34.193 --> 00:21:35.528
So, it is true.

00:21:36.162 --> 00:21:37.730
What did you say, just now?!

00:21:39.665 --> 00:21:42.168
Bloody August is alive, you say?!

00:21:42.168 --> 00:21:45.805
Well, I don't know the details, but...

00:21:46.238 --> 00:21:50.910
It seems that though it was only a little,
he's perceived Bloody August's movements.

00:21:54.113 --> 00:21:55.347
That can't be!

00:22:04.156 --> 00:22:05.224
Master...

00:22:06.358 --> 00:22:09.361
That... that can't be!

